{"the_task_sequences_derived_from_the_superni_dataset_wang_et_al_2022": "The task sequences derived from the SuperNI dataset (Wang et al., 2022) represent a collection of tasks or problems that have been extracted and formulated from the SuperNI dataset. This dataset, authored by Wang et al. in 2022, likely contains a variety of instances or scenarios used to test and validate the performance of models or systems in specific domains."},
