{"tasks": "The tasks refer to a subset of 10 specific activities or assignments selected from the SuperNI dataset for the purpose of conducting continual learning experiments. These tasks are individually trained in separate stages."},
{"tasks__encompass__various_categories_and_domains": "The predicate \"encompass\" indicates that the tasks include or cover a wide range of different elements. In this context, it means that the selected tasks from the SuperNI dataset are diverse and cover multiple areas or types of activities."},
{"various_categories_and_domains": "Various categories and domains refer to the different types and fields that the tasks cover. This implies that the tasks are not limited to a single type or field but span across multiple categories and domains, providing a comprehensive coverage for the experiments."},
{"task": "The subject, 'task', refers to a specific activity or assignment within a dataset used for instruction tuning, particularly in the context of continual learning experiments. Each task is part of a subset chosen from a larger benchmark dataset to represent various categories and domains."},
