{"1_real_data_utilization_for_icl": "1% real data utilization for ICL indicates a minimal but significant level of actual data being used in the Incremental Class Learning (ICL) process. This suggests that despite the low percentage, the data utilized is crucial for the effectiveness of the ICL system, complemented by synthetic data from previous stages."},
{"data_utilization__is__only_synthetic_data_of_previous_stages_for_rehearsal": "The predicate \"is\" in this context signifies the current state or condition of data utilization. It indicates that the described method or approach is characterized by a particular type of data usage."},
