{"table_2__show__ssr_surpasses_all_rehearsal_based_baselines_across_all_metrics": "The predicate \"show\" indicates that Table 2 serves as a visual or textual representation that demonstrates or illustrates specific outcomes or comparisons. In this case, it highlights the performance differences between SSR and other rehearsal-based baselines."},
{"ssr_surpasses_all_rehearsal_based_baselines_across_all_metrics": "The statement \"SSR surpasses all rehearsal-based baselines across all metrics\" refers to the research finding that the SSR method outperforms other rehearsal-based approaches in every measured metric within the context of the 10 SuperNI tasks. This suggests a comprehensive advantage of SSR over the compared baselines."},
