{"these_findings__suggest_that__ssr_effectively_preserves_the": "The phrase \"suggest that\" indicates a conclusion drawn from the observed data and experimental results. It implies that the evidence points towards a certain outcome or effectiveness of the method being studied."},
{"ssr_effectively_preserves_the": "SSR effectively preserves the refers to the capability of the Selective Sample Rehearsal (SSR) method to maintain or enhance the performance of the LLM across different evaluation metrics, including win rate, accuracy, and task-specific abilities, even after continual learning on new tasks."},
