{"the_best_bwt_value_of_0_02": "The best BWT value of 0.02 represents the optimal performance metric achieved by the RandSel(10%) w/ syn. op. method in continual learning order 3 for the Llama-2-7b model on SuperNI tasks. This value signifies the highest efficiency or lowest error rate attained under the given conditions."},
