{"effect_of_the_ssr_ratio_\u02c6_r_for_llama_2_7b_on_5_superni_tasks": "The object \"Effect of the SSR ratio \u02c6 _r_ for Llama-2-7b on 5 SuperNI tasks\" refers to the specific data or results being presented in Figure 8, which involves the impact of the SSR ratio on the performance of the Llama-2-7b model across five SuperNI tasks."},
{"randsel_10_with_real_inputs_and_synthetic_outputs": "RandSel (10%) with real inputs and synthetic outputs is a method used in continual learning of large language models (LLMs) that involves selecting a subset of real inputs and generating synthetic outputs for rehearsal."},
{"randsel_10_with_real_inputs_and_synthetic_outputs__outperforms__randsel_10_utilizing_only_real_instances": "Outperforms indicates that RandSel (10%) with real inputs and synthetic outputs achieves better performance compared to another method in the context of continual learning of LLMs."},
