{"exploring_self_distillation_based_relational_reasoning_training_for_document_level_relation_extraction": "The subject refers to a research study titled \"Exploring self-distillation based relational reasoning training for document-level relation extraction.\" This study investigates the application of self-distillation techniques to enhance the training process for extracting relations at the document level, aiming to improve the accuracy and efficiency of relation extraction models.|Here is another description: The subject refers to a research paper titled \"Exploring self-distillation based relational reasoning training for document-level relation extraction,\" authored by Liang Zhang, Jinsong Su, Zijun Min, Zhongjian Miao, Qingguo Hu, Biao Fu, Xiaodong Shi, and Yidong Chen. The paper discusses a novel approach to training models for extracting relations at the document level using self-distillation techniques."},
