{"r_1_rehearsal_based_baselines": "The object \"_r_ = 1% rehearsal-based baselines\" refers to a set of baseline models that use a rehearsal strategy with a 1% rehearsal rate. These baselines are used as a comparison to evaluate the performance of the SSR framework."},
