{"r_10_rehearsal_based_baselines": "The _r_ = 10% rehearsal-based baselines represent a performance benchmark in the context of machine learning, specifically within continual learning tasks. These baselines are achieved through a rehearsal strategy where 10% of the data is rehearsed or retained from previous tasks to aid in learning new tasks without forgetting the old ones."},
