{"wang_et_al_2023": "(Wang et al., 2023) refers to a research paper authored by Wang and colleagues published in the year 2023, which includes an analysis of the degradation after SFT."},
{"synthetic_instances__are_obtained_through__the_above_process": "The phrase \"are obtained through\" indicates the method or process by which the synthetic instances are generated. It suggests a procedural relationship where the synthetic instances are the result of following a specific set of steps or operations."},
{"the_above_process": "The above process refers to a previously described method or series of steps that are used to generate the synthetic instances. This process likely involves algorithms or techniques designed to create data that closely resembles real data, ensuring its utility in subsequent applications."},
{"some_synthetic_instances": "The subject refers to a collection of synthetic instances generated through a specific process. These instances are part of a series aimed at enhancing or refining outputs using advanced language models."},
