{"table_1__contains__final_results_on_5_superni_tasks_under_different_continual_learning_cl_orders": "The predicate \"contains\" indicates that Table 1 holds or includes specific data, in this case, the final results from experiments performed under various continual learning (CL) orders."},
{"final_results_on_5_superni_tasks_under_different_continual_learning_cl_orders": "The final results on 5 SuperNI tasks under different continual learning (CL) orders represent the outcomes of experiments where SuperNI tasks were performed sequentially with varying CL orders, showcasing how different orders affect the results."},
