{"ssr_with_llama_2_7b": "SSR with Llama-2-7b is a method that utilizes the Llama-2-7b model as its base language model for continual learning tasks. It is designed to improve performance over time through a series of training stages.|Here is another description: SSR with Llama-2-7b is a method used in continual learning sequences, specifically evaluated on 10 SuperNI tasks. It is compared against various rehearsal-based baselines and shows consistent improvement in performance metrics like AR and BWT throughout the learning process.|Here is another description: SSR with Llama-2-7b is a method used in continual learning processes, employing the Llama-2-7b model as its base language model. It is evaluated in a series of tasks to assess its performance against other baseline methods."},
