{"its_performance_as_the_number_of_training_stages_increases": "The object \"its performance as the number of training stages increases\" describes the enhancement in SSR with Llama-2-7b\u2019s effectiveness and results, particularly in metrics like AR and BWT, as it undergoes more training stages in the continual learning process. Initially falling behind in some metrics, it eventually surpasses other methods like RandSel(10%)."},
