{"updated_llm_\u03b8_1": "The updated LLM _\u03b8_ [(1)] refers to the enhanced version of the base language model (Llama-7b) after it has been fine-tuned, resulting in Alpaca-7b with improved capabilities."},
{"alpaca_7b__fine_tuning_on__alpaca_52k": "The predicate \"fine-tuning on\" describes the process by which Alpaca-7b was updated from its base model. This involves training the model on a specific dataset to improve its performance on particular tasks or to adapt it to new domains."},
