{"alpaca52k_qa_qg_sa_sum_trans": "The object \"Alpaca52k _\u2192_ QA _\u2192_ QG _\u2192_ SA _\u2192_ Sum. _\u2192_ Trans.\" represents a sequence of tasks within the continual learning order. Starting with Alpaca52k, it progresses through Question Answering (QA), Question Generation (QG), Sentiment Analysis (SA), Summarization (Sum.), and finally Translation (Trans.). Each task is a step in the learning journey, designed to incrementally increase in complexity and challenge."},
