{"icl__utilizes__1_0_1_of_the_training_data_from_superni_tasks_and_alpaca_52k_as_demonstrations": "The predicate \"utilizes\" indicates the action or process by which ICL makes use of a specific amount of training data. This usage is essential for demonstrating and enhancing the learning process within the given tasks."},
